---
const SITE = 'https://market.worldbatteryhub.com';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Battery Market Intelligence | World Battery Hub</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Battery market intelligence — production, export, price and regulation data with explicit source and methodology for lead-acid and lithium batteries." />
    <link rel="canonical" href={`${SITE}/`} />
    <style>
      body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.6; }
      .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
      h1, h2 { color: #0f1f3d; }
      a { color: #1d4ed8; }
      .muted { color: #64748b; font-size: 0.85rem; }
      table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.95rem; }
      th, td { text-align: left; padding: 8px 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e9f0; }
      th { color: #0f1f3d; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Battery Market Intelligence</h1>
      <p>Production, export, price and regulation data for lead-acid and lithium batteries — every figure with an explicit source and methodology.</p>

      <h2>How this data is handled</h2>
      <p>No number is published without a source and a date. See the <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a> for how figures are collected, cross-checked and flagged when they conflict.</p>

      <h2>Reports</h2>
      <p>Market reports are under construction. The first reports cover lead-acid production and export, then lithium.</p>

      <p class="muted">Return to <a href="https://worldbatteryhub.com">World Battery Hub</a>. Market data is informational and carries explicit sourcing; it is not investment or purchasing advice.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
